Package: mapr
Title: Manipulating and Projecting Maps in R
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("James", "Grecian", email = "james.grecian@gmail.com",
  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for making clean, projected maps in R. Generates land
    polygons for a region of interest defined by animal tracking data,
    cropped, buffered and projected ready for plotting with ggplot2, and
    builds the map furniture (a masking frame, graticule labels and plot
    limits) that turns a projected plot into a finished map. Coastlines
    come from the Natural Earth database via the rnaturalearth package.
License: GPL-2
URL: https://github.com/jamesgrecian/mapr
BugReports: https://github.com/jamesgrecian/mapr/issues
